              "message": "Fix: Properties editor - Constraints tab - Limit scale constraint, adjust checkboxes left #6189 (#7040)\n\n* Fix: Properties editor - Constraints tab - Limit scale constraint, adjust checkboxes left #6189\n\nThe Limit Scale constraint still used Blender's heading-row layout.\nReworked to match Limit Location/Rotation: checkboxes left in a split\ncolumn, the value field right or a disclosure triangle when disabled.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix: Properties editor - Constraints tab - Limit scale constraint - group labels #6189\n\nReview feedback: Minimum/Maximum group labels with the X/Y/Z checkboxes\nand value fields indented underneath.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
