              "message": "Fix: Text editor - File menu - Templates - rename Blender Manifest to Addon Manifest #6136 (#7037)\n\n* Fix: Text editor - File menu - Templates - rename Blender Manifest to Addon Manifest #6136\n\nRenames the template to addon_manifest.toml (the menu label follows the\nfile name) and updates the header comment to say Bforartists extension.\nThe manifest schema keys (blender_version_min etc.) stay, they are\nrequired by the shared extensions format.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix: Text editor - File menu - Templates - icons for template entries #6136\n\nReview feedback: icon support in Menu.path_menu, FILE_SCRIPT on the\nPython/OSL template entries and submenu headers, FILE_TEXT on the\nmanifest entry.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
