              "message": "Feat: Hotkeys - Edit mode - Add SHIFT+DOUBLE LMB to select islands like in Object mode #5914 (#7031)\n\nMESH_OT_select_linked_pick gains an \"extend\" option (default on, keeping\nthe old behavior). SHIFT+DOUBLE LMB selects the linked island under the\ncursor replacing the selection; SHIFT+CTRL+DOUBLE LMB extends, matching\nthe Object mode collection-select bindings in both keymap presets.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
