              "message": "Fix: Movie clip editor - sidebar - Track tab - Marker options - cluttered content #6112 (#7035)\n\n* Fix: Movie clip editor - sidebar - Track tab - Marker options - cluttered content #6112\n\nEach field pair (X/Y, Width/Height) was crammed into one row via a\nfixed-width label column next to squeezed number buttons. Each field now\ngets its own indented row with the label inside the number button.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix: Movie clip editor - sidebar - Track tab - Marker options - labels outside props #6112\n\nReview feedback: keep the X/Y/Width/Height labels in a dedicated labels\ncolumn left of the fields instead of inside the number buttons.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
