              "message": "Fix: Freedesktop - Metainfo URLs point to Bforartists #7048 (#7050)\n\nThe help, bugtracker and donation URL entries were commented out and\nstill held blender.org values. Point them at the Bforartists docs home,\nGitHub issue tracker and sponsors page, and uncomment them so AppStream\nconsumers (GNOME Software, Discover, Flathub) pick up the metadata.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
