              "message": "Fix: Sequencer - Hide Text select operators when text editing is not active #6088 (#7032)\n\nThe Select menu drew a block of greyed-out text selection operators\nwhenever a text strip was selected, though they only work while text\nediting is active. Exposes the SEQ_FLAG_TEXT_EDITING_ACTIVE flag as the\nread-only \"is_text_editing_active\" Strip property and gates the menu\nblock on it.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
